  "body": "Positioned in a peaceful Half Moon Bay cul-de-sac, this spacious single-level home brings together comfort, privacy and easy family living, all within a short walk of the Half Moon Bay Promenade and Marina.\r\n\r\nDesigned with family life in mind, the home features four bedrooms, including a generous master suite with walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite. A well-appointed family bathroom and separate toilet add further practicality for busy households.\r\n\r\nTwo separate living areas provide plenty of flexibility, giving everyone space to spread out. Whether you need a dedicated area for the kids, a quiet retreat for the adults or simply extra room for entertaining, the layout works effortlessly for everyday living.\r\n\r\nOutside, the appeal continues. A double internal-access garage provides secure parking and storage, while additional off-street space means there's room for extra vehicles or the family boat. The generous rear yard offers plenty of space for children and pets, with exciting potential for those who have always dreamed of adding a swimming pool and creating the ultimate summer entertaining area.\r\n\r\nThe location is a real highlight. Take an easy stroll to the Half Moon Bay Promenade and Marina to enjoy local cafés, eateries and the relaxed waterfront atmosphere, while regular ferry services provide a convenient connection into Auckland City.\r\n\r\nSingle-level living, four bedrooms, two living areas, room for the boat and a generous backyard, all tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac close to one of East Auckland's most desirable waterfront destinations.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a genuine family home and enjoy everything the Half Moon Bay lifestyle has to offer.",
